# SDKMAN! environment config for Tortoise.  `./sbt.sh` applies this automatically; run `sdk env` to apply it to your
# own shell, or `sdk env install` to install anything listed here that you are missing.  See the wiki's
# "Building and Running" page.
#
# Tortoise runs its generated Javascript through GraalVM's Javascript engine to test it.  On a non-GraalVM JDK that
# engine silently falls back to an interpreter (no JVMCI, so no JIT), which does not fail -- it just makes the tests
# roughly 18x slower, which reads as a hang rather than a misconfiguration.
java=25.0.2-graalce
